<view class="page login-page"><view class="brand">● ● ● <text>洋豆角</text></view><view class="title">登录后继续</view><view class="subtitle">登录后可保存专业、留学规划和咨询记录。</view><view class="card login-card"><view class="field"><text class="label">手机号或邮箱</text><input class="input" value="{{identifier}}" data-field="identifier" bindinput="input" /></view><view class="field"><text class="label">密码</text><input class="input" password value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" /></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">登录</button></view></view>
